788322368_6469445997280282245_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fcGkG-FXCLQQ7kNvwG-_YqL&_nc_oc=AdqZ7LsHJut2nxwPYxFnRIBA0yvuvYQVMFSDQ3VQf7d-NedcO0X6dT7q7LZd7-CIU08&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJkNmwV70qw1J6m0mFI-qxFG7QuxN75xvFRxMZ0rHkhdA&oe=6A9859E6"}, {"file_name": "image13_2560x1440.png", "id": "2299048247613851", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312310_2299048250947184_2237722637324550649_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GTRXmYpGdBcQ7kNvwEQTWrZ&_nc_oc=AdrmtWks_jdzyeUqwv7GrPsfuTM1SHRF2pSlFxIgSYxRhen23J148wzPlLArbdCxD24&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL7FGFqi0XjYQcJ4agklnZVYgo1nHw3UkVGGBJ-x80y1w&oe=6A985954"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "HM_2560X1440_07.png", "id": "1794030505102893", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619404_1794030508436226_3658505153522359357_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=b6ndlj8byuMQ7kNvwFdQieQ&_nc_oc=AdofF-PELUwlVkkwq5_EjCAJJh6EP2k22GlDlNzHK0qLGzZ6osu2Kl8RrB4Bsp16p7Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKeDUGHYBSYhMzWiM7LII7u8nPvR87Bvv6CRlr-powYYA&oe=6A984A3D"}, "display_name": "Haymaker", "keywords": ["ragdoll", "brawler", "brutal", "fighting", "boxing"], "long_description": "Haymaker is a physics-first VR combat brawler built around authentic body mechanics, reactive AI, and replayable close-quarters fights.\n\nStep into a combat sandbox where every grab, grapple, block, and strike is driven by physics-based interaction. The core melee system is fully playable, making each encounter feel physical, responsive, and different.\n\n{1073503735095367}\n\nUse gesture-based kicks and knees to deal damage, create space, interrupt attacks, or control multiple opponents in a crowded fight.\n\n{1564890281849082}\n\nCombat is designed to be readable and reactive. Incoming-attack indicators help players recognize enemy strike intent in real time, giving them a chance to counter, block, dodge, or intercept attacks before they land. Fighters use active ragdoll characters, so enemies and teammates react dynamically to impact, gravity, collisions, and environmental objects.\n\n{1416575043707930}\n\nTurn everyday objects into tools for combat, or spawn dedicated weapons. Grab, swing, stab, throw, and disarm using the same physics-driven interactions as hand-to-hand combat. Weapons react to momentum, impact, and positioning, allowing fights to shift naturally between fists, improvised objects, and heavier melee tools.\n\n{1048860524531597}\n\nAdaptive AI - teammates and enemies can predict target positions, choose suitable attacks, and improvise with nearby objects, creating more dynamic encounters.\n\n{1050920360634007}\n\nJoin our Discord for the latest news and updates: https://discord.gg/s8E6Gg4BHe\n", "short_description": "Haymaker is a fast, physics-driven brawler built around brutal hand-to-hand combat. Block, grab, and counter with natural motion\u2014then throw real punches and gesture-triggered kicks that land with weight. Enemy attacks are indicated before they throw their combos, leading to fast-paced action. Every fight plays out differently thanks to an advanced active ragdoll system and smart AI that attacks, blocks, and reacts dynamically in fully physical environments."}]}, "developer_name": "Console Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.haymakervr.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "GTDevice LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.haymakervr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": 